and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(241 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables;
the character 0 is the glyph 304 of the source, the slashed zero of its
feature zero. The subset carries the name "Paper Mono ASCII SemiBold".
